[node name="LashedSpears" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(110, -180)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("16_story_item")
interaction_name = "Inspect the Rack"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The watch's weapons[/b]

Two good spears, and then pitchforks and scythe blades lashed to ash poles with wet leather. Rust on every edge but the spears, which carry a hammer-over-pine mark on the socket.

If Thornhaven ever fights, this is what it fights with."
reexamine_text = "Two of Bjorn's spears and a rack of farm tools pretending to be weapons."

