[node name="NightRuts" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = -8
position = Vector2(-272, 300)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("16_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Ruts"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Cart ruts on the mill track[/b]

The track to the old mill should be grassed over; nothing has been ground there in three winters. But the ruts are fresh and deep, cut by a cart carrying something heavy, and the hoofprints are pressed over last night's frost.

Whoever drives the mill road does it after the watch has gone to bed."
reexamine_text = "Deep fresh ruts on a road to a mill that grinds nothing."

